        {
          "id": "c3d4e5f",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">From Broadway stages to Hollywood sound stages, plastic materials are essential for building sets, props, lighting diffusers, and special effects elements. Our sheets and rods are trusted by production designers, scenic shops, and prop houses for their workability, durability, and visual versatility.</p>",
