          "id": "a7b8c9d",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "html",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<style>\n.materials{background:#fff;padding:0;margin:0;font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif}\n.materials .section-header{text-align:center;padding:56px 40px 36px}\n.materials .section-header h2{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:700;color:#1B365D;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2.5px;margin:0 0 10px}\n.materials .section-header .accent-bar{width:48px;height:3px;background:#1B365D;margin:0 auto 16px;border-radius:2px}\n.materials .section-header p{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:1.05rem;color:#4A5568;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.7}\n.materials .mat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0}\n.materials .mat-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:40px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0;transition:background .25s}\n.materials .mat-card:nth-child(4n){border-right:none}\n.materials .mat-card:hover{background:#F7F8FA}\n.materials .mat-icon{width:48px;height:48px;margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.materials .mat-icon svg{width:36px;height:36px;stroke:#1B365D;stroke-width:1.5;fill:none}\n.materials .mat-name{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;color:#1B365D;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.5px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.materials .mat-desc{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:.88rem;color:#64748B;line-height:1.6}\n@media(max-width:1024px){.materials .mat-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.materials .mat-card:nth-child(4n){border-right:1px solid #E2E8F0}.materials .mat-card:nth-child(2n){border-right:none}}\n@media(max-width:600px){.materials .mat-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.materials .mat-card{border-right:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"materials\" id=\"materials\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <h2>Materials</h2>\n    <div class=\"accent-bar\"></div>\n    <p>Production-grade plastics chosen for workability, safety, and visual impact.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mat-grid\">\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"4\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"32\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">Acrylic (PMMA)</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Crystal-clear sheets for faux glass, display cases, and LED-backlit panels.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"13\"/><path d=\"M18 5v26M5 18h26\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">Polycarbonate (PC)</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Impact-resistant sheets for breakaway windows, shields, and stunt-safe panels.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><polygon points=\"18,3 33,28 3,28\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"21\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"24\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">ABS</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Tough, paintable sheets ideal for vacuum-formed props, helmets, and armor.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"24\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 14V8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v6\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">Expanded PVC (Foam Board)</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Ultra-light rigid sheets for scenic flats, set walls, and dimensional signage.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><path d=\"M6 28 Q18 4 30 28\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"26\" y2=\"20\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">Polystyrene (PS)</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Economical sheets for quick-build flats, light diffusers, and disposable props.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><ellipse cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"26\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">HDPE</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Chemical-resistant, durable sheets for outdoor sets, ramps, and work surfaces.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><path d=\"M8 28V8h8l4 8-4 8h8\" fill=\"none\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">PETG</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Thermoformable, shatter-resistant sheets for face shields, visors, and clear props.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mat-card\">\n      <div class=\"mat-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"6\"/></svg></div>\n      <div class=\"mat-name\">PVC (Rigid)</div>\n      <div class=\"mat-desc\">Weather-resistant sheets for outdoor stages, rain covers, and protective barriers.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
          },
          "elements": []
